  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/13d28648-1aba-49c9-9356-bb6fea157e12-image.png\" style=\"width: 656px; height: 70px;\" /></p><p>Considering the above reactions, the compound &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&#39; and compound &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&#39; respectively are</p>",
